# Data Flow - Context Diagram (Level 0) Template

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph "External Entities"
        User[User]
        ExtSys[External System]
        Sensor[IoT Sensor]
    end
    
    subgraph "System Boundary"
        Process[Core Process]
    end
    
    User -->|Input Data| Process
    ExtSys -->|API Calls| Process
    Sensor -->|Telemetry| Process
    
    Process -->|Response| User
    Process -->|Results| ExtSys
    Process -->|Commands| Sensor
    
    style Process fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00,stroke-width:2px
```

## Usage
Define your system boundary, external entities, and data flows.